{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05841","headline":"戏赠张五弟諲三首 二 · 王维","name":"戏赠张五弟諲三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"张弟五车书，读书仍隐居。\n染翰过草圣，赋诗轻子虚。\n闭门二室下，隐居十年余。\n宛是野人野，时从渔夫渔。\n秋风自萧索，五柳高且疎。\n望此去人世，渡水向吾庐。\n岁晏同携手，只应君与予。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05841.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05841","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}